{"lang":"zh","dir":"ltr","title":"Romack Home Maintenance Services (Rowmack Inc.) | 加州瓦卡维尔家居维修师傅","body":"<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">跳到主要内容</a>\n<header class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"wrap topbar-in\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">R</span><span>Romack Home Maintenance Services</span></a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\"><a href=\"#about\">关于我们</a><a href=\"#services\">服务</a><a href=\"#faq\">常见问题</a><a href=\"#gallery\">照片</a><a href=\"#reviews\">评价</a><a href=\"#visit\">营业时间和地址</a></nav>\n    <label class=\"lang-pick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20zm6.9 6h-2.9a15.7 15.7 0 0 0-1.4-3.6A8 8 0 0 1 18.9 8zM12 4c.8 1.2 1.5 2.5 1.9 4h-3.8c.4-1.5 1.1-2.8 1.9-4zM4.3 14a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0-4h3.4a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0 4H4.3zm.8 2h2.9c.3 1.3.8 2.5 1.4 3.6A8 8 0 0 1 5.1 16zM8 8H5.1a8 8 0 0 1 4.3-3.6C8.8 5.5 8.3 6.7 8 8zm4 12c-.8-1.2-1.5-2.5-1.9-4h3.8c-.4 1.5-1.1 2.8-1.9 4zm2.3-6H9.7a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0-4h4.6a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0 4zm.3 5.6c.6-1.1 1.1-2.3 1.4-3.6h2.9a8 8 0 0 1-4.3 3.6zM16.3 14a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0-4h3.4a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0 4h-3.4z\"/></svg><select id=\"langSel\" aria-label=\"语言\"><option value=\"en\" lang=\"en\">English</option><option value=\"es\" lang=\"es\">Español</option><option value=\"tl\" lang=\"tl\">Tagalog</option><option value=\"vi\" lang=\"vi\">Tiếng Việt</option><option value=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\" selected>中文</option><option value=\"pa\" lang=\"pa\">ਪੰਜਾਬੀ</option><option value=\"hi\" lang=\"hi\">हिन्दी</option><option value=\"ko\" lang=\"ko\">한국어</option><option value=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">العربية</option></select></label>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17073178126\">致电</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"hero-bg\" style=\"background-image:url('images/cedar-steps.jpg')\"></div>\n  <div class=\"wrap hero-in\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">维修师傅 · 加州瓦卡维尔 · Rowmack Inc.</p>\n    <h1>Romack Home Maintenance Services</h1>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">什么都能修的师傅。Bob Mackert 凭借 25 年以上经验，为你家做维修、安装和木工，一次专心做好一个项目。</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\"><a class=\"rating-badge\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Romack+Home+maintenance+services/@38.3342357,-121.9779348,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d4c259ea703:0x2839b9bca65479b8!8m2!3d38.3342357!4d-121.9779348!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>4.9 · Google 上的 39 条评价<span class=\"ext\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><span class=\"open-badge\" id=\"openBadge\" hidden></span></div>\n    <div class=\"cta-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"tel:+17073178126\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> 致电或短信联系 Bob</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=Romack%20Home%20Maintenance%20Services%2C%20Vacaville%2C%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> 地图</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stripe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"highlights\"><div class=\"wrap\"><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Romack+Home+maintenance+services/@38.3342357,-121.9779348,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d4c259ea703:0x2839b9bca65479b8!8m2!3d38.3342357!4d-121.9779348!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">39 条评价，4.9★</a></li><li>25 年以上经验</li><li>常常当天回复</li><li>每次完工都清理干净</li><li>接受信用卡</li><li>周六营业</li></ul></div></div>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"wrap about-grid\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">认识 Bob</p><h2>一次专心做好一个项目。</h2><p>Romack Home Maintenance Services，又名 Rowmack Inc.，就是我——瓦卡维尔的维修师傅 Robert &quot;Bob&quot; Mackert。我有 25 年以上经验，只要你的项目和木头或房子有关，从简单的到定制的，我会的活儿多着呢。</p><p>我回复快，常常当天就回，准时到场，收费公道，完工后自己收拾干净。很多客户家里一个项目接一个项目地找我。</p><div class=\"facts\"><a class=\"fact\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Romack+Home+maintenance+services/@38.3342357,-121.9779348,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d4c259ea703:0x2839b9bca65479b8!8m2!3d38.3342357!4d-121.9779348!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>4.9★</b><span>39 条评价</span></a><div class=\"fact\"><b>25 年以上</b><span>经验</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><b>周一至周六</b><span>每周营业 6 天</span></div></div></div><div class=\"about-img\"><img src=\"images/entry-steps.jpg\" alt=\"带扶手的木质入户台阶\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"services\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">服务项目</p><h2>Bob 能做什么</h2></div><div class=\"services\"><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">01</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>石膏板与墙面纹理</h3></div><p>石膏板修补和天花板纹理。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">02</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>门的安装与维修</h3></div><p>室内门、外门和车库侧门的安装、调整和维修。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">03</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>地板安装与维修</h3></div><p>复合地板和踢脚线。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">04</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>家具组装</h3></div><p>书桌等家具，快速组装。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">05</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>木工</h3></div><p>木作项目，从简单到定制。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">06</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>腐朽木料清除与更换</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">07</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>填缝打胶</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">08</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>水管维修</h3></div><p>更换花洒和其他洁具配件。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">09</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>灯具与电器安装</h3></div><p>吊扇和灶台上方微波炉，旧电器帮你拉走。</p></article></div><p class=\"note\">我不在网上公布价格，但收费一向公道合理。请致电或发短信到 (707) 317-8126，聊聊你的项目。</p></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"amenities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">温馨提示</p><h2>温馨提示</h2></div><ul class=\"amenities\"><li><b>接受信用卡</b></li><li><b>回复快</b><span>常常当天，有时一小时内</span></li><li><b>清理工作区域</b><span>每次完工我都会清理干净</span></li><li><b>旧电器帮你拉走</b></li><li><b>周六营业</b><span>上午 9 点至下午 3 点</span></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">相册</p><h2>近期项目</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/tile-shower.jpg\" alt=\"贴瓷砖的淋浴墙\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/fireplace-wall.jpg\" alt=\"石材壁炉墙\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/deck-rebuild.jpg\" alt=\"施工中的木平台\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/treehouse-deck.jpg\" alt=\"架高木平台\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/shed.jpg\" alt=\"储物棚\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/garden-bench.jpg\" alt=\"木质花园长椅\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/laminate-floor.jpg\" alt=\"走廊里的仿木地板\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/entry-steps.jpg\" alt=\"木质入户台阶\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"press\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">店主</p><h2>Bob 的自述</h2></div><div class=\"press\"><figure class=\"press-item\"><blockquote>“Handyman services, With the one project at a time attitude. laminate floor installation, Doors installed, With over 25 yrs experience, If your project involves wood and/or houses, My list of skills goes on, From simple to custom, You get what you want with Rowmack .inc Simply put, The handyman that can.”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Robert Mackert, owner</b> · In Bob&#39;s words</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">评价</p><h2>顾客怎么说</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.9</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 39 条评价</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Romack+Home+maintenance+services/@38.3342357,-121.9779348,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d4c259ea703:0x2839b9bca65479b8!8m2!3d38.3342357!4d-121.9779348!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">在 Google 上查看更多评价 →</a></div></div><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.5</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Yelp</b> · 12 条评价</div><a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/rowmack-vacaville-3#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">在 Yelp 上查看更多评价 →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“He is the best handyman I’ve ever hired. Very professional and kind. We are very satisfied.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jan 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I am absolutely thrilled to write a review for Robert, who recently installed a ceiling fan in my home. From start to finish, the experience was nothing short of exceptional. Robert is the epitome of professionalism. He arrived precisely on time, which I greatly appreciate, and immediately got to work. Beyond his punctuality, his demeanor was incredibly pleasant, and he even had a great sense of humor that made the whole process enjoyable. What truly set Robert apart was his keen eye and observant nature. He noticed a small detail about the wiring that could have caused an issue down the line…”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jul 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“My husband text Bob, today Sunday March 2, 2025 to replace a shower head in one of our bathrooms. Bob, responded immediately and said that he’d be out today, he arrived within the hour and replaced the shower head within a few minutes. He’s quick, reasonably priced and more importantly, he cleans up behind himself. We use Bob on a regular basis for various repairs around the house.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Mar 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Bob is very helpful, very affordable and upfront. I called and he showed up within an hour and a half. I had one project that I called him out for, but after having him look at the main project, I intend on using his services for all of my other projects that need to be taken care of.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“I called ROWMACK today and spoke with Robert Mackert. I will be working from home starting tomorrow and my desk was still in the box!!! Bob came to my house and within an hour my desk was complete. He is also very nice. So if you need someone to put your furniture together, please call my new handy man at ROWMACK INC! Trust me, you will be glad you did!!!”</blockquote><figcaption>— BestProsInTown reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.bestprosintown.com/ca/vacaville/rowmack-inc-/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BestProsInTown</a> · Jan 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Robert responded the same day. He arrived on time and went to work. Completed task in a reasonable time and charged a fair fee for a difficult job. Cleaned up his work area. I am very pleased and would not hesitate to hire him again.”</blockquote><figcaption>— BestProsInTown reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.bestprosintown.com/ca/vacaville/rowmack-inc-/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BestProsInTown</a> · Sep 2023</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Bob is an excellent worker. Shows up when he says he will and makes sure whatever he is working on is repaired correctly. We’ve had three different people work on our door, but they never fixed it. Bob put in the time to make sure it was done correctly. He is reasonable in his pricing and very kind. We will definitely be using his services in the future!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2022</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Bob of Rowmack Inc Handyman Services did a side garage door install. He knew exactly what was required to start and finish the project in a timely matter. His professional talent produced outstanding results. I am more than pleased with his work. I have already ask Bob to schedule me in for another install in the kitchen. Highly Recommended”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Mar 2022</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Such great service received today. I found Bob&#39;s information while searching for someone to install my over the range microwave. I reached out to Bob and he was very responsive and was able to get me all set up this morning. Bob even recommended an earlier time. I really can say what quality work and Bob hauled away the old appliance as well. I will recommend Bob to anyone and even make use of him again for other things needed to be done in my house. If I could have given 10 stars I would.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2021</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Bob knows his stuff! He did an awesome job installing our lament flooring and baseboards, he also was so fast at texturing my ceilings, and did some great electrical work for us. I love how flexible he is with our schedule and overall really fun to work with, I would highly recommend for any construction job!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Apr 2018</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">常见问题</p><h2>常见问题解答</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>Romack 和 Rowmack Inc. 是同一家吗？</summary><p>是的，都是我。我是 Robert &quot;Bob&quot; Mackert，我的生意既叫 Romack Home Maintenance Services，也叫 Rowmack Inc.。</p></details><details><summary>你接哪些活？</summary><p>石膏板修补和纹理、门、复合地板和踢脚线、家具组装、木工、腐木修复、填缝打胶、更换水管配件、吊扇和电器安装。只要和木头或房子有关，尽管问。</p></details><details><summary>多快能上门？</summary><p>通常很快。我常常当天就能回复，有时一小时或一个半小时内。</p></details><details><summary>收费多少？</summary><p>我不在网上公布价格，但收费公道、实惠，事先讲清楚。请致电或发短信到 (707) 317-8126，跟我说说你的项目。</p></details><details><summary>工作时间是什么时候？</summary><p>我周一至周五上午 7 点至下午 6 点、周六上午 9 点至下午 3 点工作。周日休息。</p></details><details><summary>收信用卡吗？</summary><p>收，我接受信用卡。</p></details><details><summary>你有多少年经验？</summary><p>我有 25 年以上的经验。</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">服务范围</p>\n      <h2>营业时间和服务范围</h2>\n      <address>服务地区：Vacaville, CA<br>位于 Vacaville, CA 95687</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17073178126\">(707) 317-8126</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>星期一</td><td>7 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>星期二</td><td>7 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>星期三</td><td>7 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>星期四</td><td>7 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>星期五</td><td>7 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>星期六</td><td>9 AM – 3 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>星期日</td><td>休息</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">致电或发短信预约上门。</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\"><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Romack+Home+maintenance+services/@38.3342357,-121.9779348,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d4c259ea703:0x2839b9bca65479b8!8m2!3d38.3342357!4d-121.9779348!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Google</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"ht